I go into the bedroom.
I carry the suitcase in from the living room.
I open the suitcase.
I take my clothes out.
I fold the clothes.
I put it in the wardrobe.
Now my sweaters lie in the wardrobe.
There is a large bed in the room.
There lies a thick blanket on the bed.
The blanket is from Mexico.
I also find a pair of slippers.
They are very soft.
There stands a small chair by the wall.
I put my slippers on the floor.
Now they lie under the chair.
Now the suitcase is empty.
I close it and put it under the bed.
